### Welcome Route
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Add Hotel
POST http://localhost:3000/hotels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grand Palace Hotel",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "rating": 4.8,
  "pricePerNight": 2500
}

### Get All Hotels
GET http://localhost:3000/hotels

### Filter Hotels by Rating
GET http://localhost:3000/hotels?rating=4.8

### Get Hotel by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/hotels/1

### Update Hotel
PUT http://localhost:3000/hotels/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grand Palace Resort & Spa",
  "location": "Mumbai",
  "rating": 4.9,
  "pricePerNight": 3000
}

### Delete Hotel
DELETE http://localhost:3000/hotels/1
